@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Plane Management)

[*] --> Order : Plane Acquired

state "Order" as Order
Order : entry / Plane received
Order : do / Wait for delivery
Order : exit / Plane delivered

Order --> Arrival : Plane Delivered

state "Arrival" as Arrival
Arrival : entry / Plane arrived
Arrival : do / Transition to Preparation
Arrival : exit / Plane prepared

Arrival --> Preparation : Plane Arrived

state "Preparation" as Preparation
Preparation : entry / Plane prepared
Preparation : do / Assign plane to Operations or Maintenance
Preparation : exit / Plane assigned

Preparation --> J1 <<choice>>
J1 --> Operations : Scheduled Flights Available
Operations : entry / Plane in operations
Operations : do / Monitor scheduled flights
Operations : exit / No more scheduled flights

J1 --> Maintenance : No Scheduled Flights or Maintenance Required
Maintenance : entry / Plane sent to maintenance
Maintenance : do / Check and service plane
Maintenance : exit / Plane ready for preparation

Preparation --> Preparation : Plane Condition Changed

Maintenance --> Preparation : Plane Serviced

state "Operations" as Operations
Operations : entry / Plane in operations
Operations : do / Monitor scheduled flights
Operations : exit / No more scheduled flights

Operations --> Maintenance : No Scheduled Flights or Maintenance Required

state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / Plane sent to maintenance
Maintenance : do / Check and service plane
Maintenance : exit / Plane ready for preparation

Maintenance --> Preparation : Plane Serviced

state "Withdrawn from Service" as WithdrawnFromService
WithdrawnFromService : entry / Plane permanently withdrawn
WithdrawnFromService : do / Remove plane from operations
WithdrawnFromService : exit / Plane removed

Operations --> WithdrawnFromService : Plane Permanently Withdrawn
Maintenance --> WithdrawnFromService : Plane Permanently Withdrawn

[*] --> WithdrawnFromService : Plane No Longer Available

@enduml
